<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">05042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Forty-eight hours remain on Donald Trump's ultimatum to Iran — accept a fifteen-point American proposal or face strikes on power plants, oil infrastructure, and desalination targets.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Tehran's foreign minister confirmed Iran never refused talks and is willing to negotiate in Islamabad, but only for what he called a conclusive and lasting agreement, not a surrender document dictated by Washington.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Pakistan's mediation is now the last diplomatic channel before the deadline expires, and Senator Lindsey Graham has already endorsed what he called a massive military operation.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's airstrike on Kabul last month killed four hundred and eleven Afghans, including patients at a drug rehabilitation center the military labeled a legitimate target.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>One mother, Samira Muhammadi, is now demanding an international investigation after losing her son in the strike — but no court, no tribunal, and no international body has opened a case.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The ICC requires a documented pattern of strikes before it'll prosecute, which means the first bombing is effectively free.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's forty thousand resident doctors will walk off the job Tuesday at midnight, leaving the country's two hundred and twenty million people without resident physician coverage in public hospitals.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The government suspended a professional allowance agreement and owes nineteen months of back pay — a pattern across the continent where states sign deals under pressure and quietly stop implementing them.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>In the same week, the capital's minister Wike said on live television he'd have shot a Channels TV journalist for suggesting the ruling party is building a one-party state — and he still holds his post.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Somalia's parliament passed a new constitution by two hundred and twenty-three votes to zero, and two of the country's most powerful regions immediately rejected it.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Puntland and Jubaland have governed autonomously since nineteen ninety-one, each commanding its own armed forces and collecting its own taxes.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The unanimous vote in Mogadishu may have formalized on paper a national split that already exists on the ground.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Lebanese-French artist Ali Cherri has filed a war crimes complaint in French courts after an Israeli airstrike killed both his parents in Beirut's Nouaire neighborhood.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Cherri spoke to his mother by phone minutes before the strike while boarding a plane to Vienna — then landed to the news that both parents were dead.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The filing invokes France's universal jurisdiction, forcing prosecutors to either accept the case or explain on the record why Israel is exempt.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russian strikes killed five civilians in Ukraine's Nikopol just hours before Zelensky arrived in Istanbul for talks with Erdogan.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Turkey's president hosted a two-hour session after speaking with Putin on Friday, pledging support for both negotiations and Black Sea shipping lanes.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Ukraine is pushing for an Orthodox Easter ceasefire — Russia's response so far has been artillery.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The EU's fuel reserves will empty around April twentieth, according to Russia's envoy Dmitriev, who says the last tankers that cleared the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="streɪt əv hɔrˈmuːz">Strait of Hormuz</phoneme> before its closure reach European ports by April eleventh.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>After that, depletion follows within days as the strait's closure passes its fifth week.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>EU energy ministers now have sixteen days to agree on rationing — or find supply that doesn't exist.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Forty-five million people across South Asia and the Pacific face acute hunger by mid twenty-twenty-six as war-risk insurance on the Hormuz corridor has surged twenty-five to fifty percent.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The waterway carries a fifth of the world's oil, and the cost spike is pushing food beyond reach from Pakistan to the Philippines — countries that didn't start this war but are paying for it in empty kitchens.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The UN's humanitarian office is seeking a hundred and fifty-one million dollars for Pakistan's flood response alone, warning the toll compounds if crude stays above a hundred dollars a barrel.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Malaysia has ordered one point eight million public servants to work from home after Prime Minister Anwar cut subsidized fuel quotas by a third.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>A Southeast Asian nation five thousand kilometers from the war is now restructuring how its entire government operates because of Hormuz disruption.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Iran promised Malaysia's state oil company Petronas exemptions for passage but hasn't set a date — leaving the promise as empty as the fuel tanks.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Four years after the most powerful volcanic eruption in modern history, Tonga still can't rebuild because it's servicing Chinese debt.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The country's seventeen point seven million dollar annual repayment to China's Exim Bank nearly doubles its entire infrastructure budget of ten point one million — the definition of a structural trap.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Beijing hasn't offered restructuring, and the IMF's distress warnings haven't changed the math for a Pacific island nation with no leverage.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers have built the first single-cell aging clock using the same attention-network architecture that powers large language models — trained on sixteen million cell transcriptomes across forty human tissues.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The tool predicts biological age with under ten years' mean error for half of all cell types, revealing that different organs and tissues age at starkly different rates within the same body.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Its most striking finding is that tumor cells appear biologically younger than the tissue surrounding them, a gap that could reshape how targeted therapies are designed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Native Americans were gambling twelve thousand years ago — six and a half thousand years before any known equivalent in the Old World.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>A study of three hundred Pleistocene artifacts across fifty-seven archaeological sites identified binary-lot dice that predate Near Eastern gambling by millennia.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The discovery credits hunter-gatherers, not agricultural civilizations, with humanity's earliest experiments in probabilistic reasoning.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Artemis two has crossed into the Moon's gravitational sphere and will fly within four thousand miles of the lunar surface on Sunday, God willing.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Koch and Hansen will become the first woman and first non-American to reach lunar distance — milestones more than half a century overdue.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The flyby sets a distance record, but Artemis three's planned landing faces a twenty-three percent NASA budget cut that could delay boots on the surface indefinitely.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Chinese private firms are combining Jilin satellite imagery with AI and open-source data to track US military movements in near real-time — and selling the product commercially.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>The same tools that power competitive intelligence startups now enable private companies to conduct what amounts to military surveillance as a subscription service.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>No legal framework anywhere in the world currently distinguishes commercial satellite analytics from espionage.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's internet regulator tried to block VPNs nationwide and crashed the country's payment infrastructure instead.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Overloaded packet filters brought down Sberbank's systems and forced Moscow's metro turnstiles open — millions of commuters riding free while the censorship apparatus ate itself.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>A new VPN traffic fee takes effect April fifteenth, assuming the infrastructure survives the enforcement.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Linux kernel seven point zero has halved PostgreSQL throughput on Amazon Web Services — a fifty percent performance drop on the world's most popular open-source database running on the world's largest cloud.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>An AWS engineer traced the regression to scheduler changes that were never tested against database workloads, a gap in the testing matrix that no one caught before release.</s> <break time="600ms"/> <s>Fixing it risks breaking other systems that depend on those same scheduler assumptions, and no patch has been released.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>